" data-target="browse"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default during_submit has_banner" id="view_jam_7818049"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UyL2phbS80MTQ0NDUvMjU4MDA2NzQucG5n/original/gO2R%2F3.png" class="jam_banner full_width"/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_2981170"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026">Yaoi Game Jam 2026</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://witpop.itch.io">WitPOP</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/yaoijam">#yaoijam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">366</div><div class="stat_label">Joined</div></div><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026/entries"><div class="stat_value">7</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a class="header_tab active" href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026" data-label="tab_view_jam">Overview</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026/entries" data-label="tab_view_jam_entries">Submissions</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">33</span></div><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026/feed" data-label="tab_view_jam_feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget during_submit" id="jam_submitter_8327535"><div class="date_data">Submissions open from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-06-30 14:00:01</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-08-31 13:59:59</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Submissions due in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action"><button data-method="post" class="button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn" data-href="/jam/414445/join">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><p><strong>★&nbsp;</strong><strong><a target="_blank" href="https://bsky.app/profile/yaoijam.bsky.social" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Bluesky</a>&nbsp;★&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://x.com/YaoiJam" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">X (Twitter)</a>&nbsp;★</strong></p>
<p><strong>Yaoi Game Jam</strong>&nbsp;is a two month long jam running from July 1st to August 31st (AEST), dedicated to making games featuring male-identified characters in queer relationships.</p>
<p>Traditionally, the term &quot;<em>yaoi</em>,&quot; also known as &quot;<em>boy&#x27;s love</em>,&quot; refers to female-oriented works from Japan, or works inspired by those works, that feature two or more male characters in a romantic relationship. However, this game jam is open to stories about all kinds of relationships between queer-identified men, from platonic to romantic, and everything in-between!
</p>
<p>This jam was first inspired by&nbsp;<a href="https://itch.io/jam/yuri-game-jam">Yuri Game Jam</a>, which first ran in Fall 2015.
</p>
<p>You can view games from previous years here: <a href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2025" target="_blank">YaoiJam2025</a>,&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2024">YaoiJam2024</a>,&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2023">YaoiJam2023,</a>&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoi-jam-game-2022">YaoiJam2022</a>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam2021">YaoiJam2021</a>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam2020">YaoiJam2020</a>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam19/entries">YaoiJam2019</a>,&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam18/entries">YaoiJam2018</a>,&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam17/entries">YaoiJam2017</a>,&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://itch.io/jam/yaoijam/entries">YaoiJam2016</a>&nbsp;
</p>
<h1></h1>
<h1>Rules for YaoiJam2026</h1>
<ol><li>&nbsp;Your game must focus on queer relationships between men OR the queer male experience. This includes: gay, bi, trans, non-binary, aro, ace, pan, any male-identified LGBTQIA characters.
</li><li>This is an inclusive jam and anyone can join. Although uncomfortable subjects can be explored, please be considerate of the themes/material used, and fellow creators/players. Remember to appropriately tag your games.
</li><li>You may begin working on projects before the jam starts, but all submissions MUST be new games created for YaoiGameJam2026. To ensure this, you must state &#x27;<em>Made for YaoiGameJam2026</em>&#x27; on your game&#x27;s page.&nbsp; Games that do not have this will be removed without warning.</li><li>The following types of entries are prohibited: games&nbsp;promoting bigotry (i.e transphobic/racism), games using AI-generated assets.
</li></ol>
<h1></h1>
<h1>FAQ</h1>
<p><strong>I&#x27;m already working on a game that has a demo released, can I submit that to YaoiJam?&nbsp;</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>No, you may only submit new games. If your game&#x27;s page was published before July 1st 2026, it will be removed from submission without warning.</li></ul>
<p><strong>Do I need to make my assets from scratch, or can I use pre-made/CC/paid assets?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>No, you don&#x27;t need to make your assets from scratch unless that is something you wish to do.&nbsp; You can use pre-made, recycled,&nbsp; CC, newly commissioned, paid etc assets.&nbsp;If using CC/paid assets, be sure to abide by the asset&#x27;s licensing.
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Can I submit my Yaoi Jam&nbsp;entry into multiply jams?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Yes. As long as&nbsp;your project abides by all the rules in each game jam you wish to submit to.
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Can I submit more than one entry?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Yes.&nbsp;
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Can my entry be about&nbsp;characters that aren&#x27;t male or in queer relationships?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Although your entry may have a plethora of diverse characters, it&nbsp;<em>must</em>&nbsp;have a primary focus on queer relationships between male-identified characters (the nature of the relationship can be romantic, platonic, or anything in between). Or it may focus on the experiences of queer males.&nbsp;
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Can I submit a NSFW entry?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Yes. All games should be properly tagged and labelled, if your entry is not appropriate for minors, you must label that in the game&#x27;s description.
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Does my game need to be a visual novel?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>No. As long as your game focuses on&nbsp;queer relationships between men OR the queer male experience, your game could be anything. In the past we&#x27;ve had RPGs, TTRPGs, interactive fictions, and even a block breaker game!</li></ul>
<p><strong>Will there be prizes?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>No.&nbsp;
</li></ul>
<p><strong>Is there a discord?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Due to mass bots joining the Discord lately, if you want an invite link to the BLVN discord server please DM @red8891 on discord for an invite.&nbsp;</li></ul>
<p><strong>Does my game need to be in English?</strong>
</p>
<ul><li>Games can be in any language, but it&#x27;s recommended to include an English version for mod checking.</li></ul>
<p><span></span></p>
<p><em>Logo by&nbsp;<a href="https://twitter.com/skyharborr" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Reikun</a>&nbsp; Originally run by&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://z04.itch.io/">z04</a></em><em>&nbsp;Currently hosted by&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://witpop.itch.io/">WitPOP</a></em>
</p></div></div><div id="entries" class="grid_outer"><div class="header_row"><h2>Submitted so far<span class="game_count">(7)</span></h2></div><div class="jam_filter_picker"><div class="filter_item active">All submissions</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_web" class="filter_item">Browser playable (5)</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_windows" class="filter_item">Windows (6)</div><div data-filter="filter_osx" class="filter_item">macOS (4)</div><div data-filter="filter_linux" class="filter_item">Linux (5)</div></div><div class="jam_filter_empty"><p>No submissions match your filter</p></div><div class="game_grid_widget base_widget browse_game_grid"><div class="game_cell filter_html filter_windows filter_osx filter_linux filter_web has_cover lazy_images" dir="auto" data-game_id="4770596"><div style="background-color:#081636;" class="game_thumb"><a class="thumb_link game_link" tabindex="-1" data-label="game:4770596:thumb" href="https://nqztan.itch.io/finale-garden" data-action="game_grid"><img height="250" class="lazy_loaded" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NDY5NjUyLnBuZw==/315x250%23c/frtyFt.png" width="315"/></a><div class="game_cell_tools"><a class="action_btn add_to_collection_btn" href="/g/nqztan/finale-garden/add-to-collection" data-register_action="add_to_collection"><span class="icon icon-playlist_add"></span>Add to collection</a></div></div><div class="game_cell_data"><div class="game_title"><a class="title game_link" data-action="game_grid" href="https://nqztan.itch.io/finale-garden" data-label="game:4770596:title">Finale Garden</a></div><div title="See you in the next life." class="game_text">See you in the next life.</div><div class="game_author"><a data-action="game_grid" data-label="user:15341266" href="https://nqztan.itch.io">nqztan</a></div><div class="game_genre">Visual Novel</div><div class="game_platform"><span class="web_flag">Play in browser</span><span class="icon icon-windows8" ar